 "firesideCount": 9,
 "tableLines": [
  {
   "day": 17,
   "line": "✨ Ability gained: Fusion Reactor (L1). The System installs your fusion pellet — properly, inside you. You never need to eat again: the pellet covers your metabolism, and your strikes and abilities burn with a steady reactor fire (1.25x, always on). One reactor per world, and it never comes out: not unslotted, not un-taught, not surrendered. Death is the only uninstall. But the hunger is gone, and "
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Daniela speaks at Emberhold's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Daniela speaks at Stonebridge's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 57,
   "line": "The village feels it before they understand it: Haven isn't just Haven anymore. Daniela speaks at Thornfield's table now — earned, not appointed. And the other fire is watching what Haven does FIRST."
  },
  {
   "day": 90,
   "line": "◈ THE TABLE — the ring of pale light flickers at the edge of the sky... and does not come. The System does not apologize this time. \"WE PRICED THE RUN. NO HUNGER ON THE RECORD — THE PELLET HUMS WHERE THE FIRE SHOULD BE. NO FEAST, NO SURGE, NOTHING HERE WE CAN PRICE. A COLD SPOT AT EVERY TABLE: THE WORDS WERE ON THE WRAPPER.\" The ledger still wants: wave-3 monsters faced; the food-thesis deeds (no "
  },
  {
   "day": 107,
   "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Oh. OH. Do you feel that? That's the whole PLANET leaning in. ...There's a table, little fires. A big one. Far away. And it is LOOKING at you. Give it a season worth judging.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 129,
   "line": "You caught the lie in his face and watched the whole table react to it before he'd finished the sentence. Face and room, both open books."
  },
  {
   "day": 177,
   "line": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
  }
 ],
